WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.016
Touch this stone in your mind: granodiorite, nearly as hard as the tools that shape it.

00:00:07.016 --> 00:00:18.225
Quarrymen split it from the living rock at Aswan, crews dragged it for hundreds of kilometers, and sculptors spent months on a single face.

00:00:18.225 --> 00:00:25.000
Choosing such stone was already a statement — this image must outlast time itself.

